[00:33.00] When the earth has been ravaged and the animals are dying,
[00:36.00] the tribe of people, more races, creeds and colours,
[00:40.00] will put their faith in deer to not word,
[00:43.00] to make the land green again.
[00:45.00] They shall be known as the warriors of the rainbow,
[00:48.00] protectors of the environment.
